@section raw_fdd4e563fbac24d1 src/dummy_moveit_config/test/fixtures/fk_cases.json

这份原件是离线/历史证据，下面区分原记录实际范围与不能推出的结论。

原文 SHA256：`fdd4e563fbac24d16ce85187cd1755664fb5a47c800764a513404ea5bbb35d64`；1140 B；1 个物理路径共用此内容。每份路径仍单独列在 @ref ros_contract_data_sources 。

四固定数学病例的joints单位是degree、position是m、rotation是row-major3×3。原`home=[0,0,0,0,0,0]`不等当前GUI Home的J3=π/2；`joint6_multiturn=540deg`保持多圈语义，不能正规化为单圈后沿用原数值oracle。physical_calibration_verified仍false。

| 病例 | 旧输入deg | 旧位置m | 旋转矩阵row-major | 范围 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| home | `[0,0,0,0,0,0]` | `[-0.0170000084,1.11464038e-08,0.442000002]` | `[1,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,1]` | 固定legacy FK数学对照，非可下发目标 |
| legacy_rest | `[0,-73,180,0,0,0]` | `[0.0894118249,-1.75979409e-09,0.146740615]` | `[-0.292371601,4.18014103e-08,0.956304789,-4.18014103e-08,1,-5.64913591e-08,-0.956304789,-5.64913591e-08,-0.292371601]` | 固定legacy FK数学对照，非可下发目标 |
| asymmetric | `[10,-40,95,20,-15,45]` | `[0.0527647138,0.00283199735,0.383634239]` | `[0.217622042,-0.721605599,0.657210767,0.950293839,0.310267031,0.0259970929,-0.222670466,0.618885756,0.753258348]` | 固定legacy FK数学对照，非可下发目标 |
| joint6_multiturn | `[0,0,0,0,0,540]` | `[-0.0170000084,1.11464038e-08,0.442000002]` | `[-1,9.7752411e-07,0,-9.7752411e-07,-1,0,0,0,1]` | 固定legacy FK数学对照，非可下发目标 |

@section raw_9eb1d92746595146 contracts/dummy_robot_v2/evidence/release_manifest.schema.json

这份原件是离线/历史证据，下面区分原记录实际范围与不能推出的结论。

原文 SHA256：`9eb1d92746595146a77c3978306b284ec3ce11adcdae3e7daae622420b58d092`；1460 B；1 个物理路径共用此内容。每份路径仍单独列在 @ref ros_contract_data_sources 。

这是正式release **结构schema**，不是已批准实例。required十五个字段绑定image大小/0x08000000地址、model/profile/compiled policy、firmware源码、contract、mask63/profile201及resource/map/measurement摘要；additionalProperties=false、stage常量RELEASE_APPROVED也不能认证任意自填JSON已获批准。该地址是schema约束，不是刷写操作指令。

| 必需键 | 原schema约束 | 绑定角色 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `format` | `{"const":"dummy_final_release_manifest_v1"}` | 必须dummy_final_release_manifest_v1。 |
| `release_stage` | `{"const":"RELEASE_APPROVED"}` | 实例标签必须RELEASE_APPROVED，标签本身不代审批。 |
| `firmware_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | image原SHA，不是contract聚合。 |
| `image_size` | `{"type":"integer","minimum":1}` | 正整数B数，须与实际image核。 |
| `flash_address` | `{"const":134217728}` | 固定134217728=0x08000000，数据约束不是烧录指令。 |
| `model_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 模型原SHA，方向/比例/限位整体绑定。 |
| `profile_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | profile原身份，非ID201。 |
| `compiled_policy_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 编译策略canonical身份。 |
| `firmware_source_binding_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 固件源码绑定原件身份，不能用image SHA代。 |
| `contract_identity` | `{"const":"dummy_wire_release_v2"}` | 固定dummy_wire_release_v2格式身份。 |
| `configured_mask` | `{"const":63}` | 六轴63，非node位图。 |
| `profile_id` | `{"const":201}` | 六轴bench201。 |
| `resource_baseline_hash` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 正式资源基线身份，不能用component OBSERVED替。 |
| `map_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 实际链接map原件身份。 |
| `measurement_report_sha256` | `{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}` | 实际测量报告原SHA，非null或假PASS标签。 |

@section raw_7297d7259a5be59a docs/dummy/handoffs/R06-to-DPSDK-operation-enum-blocker.json

这份原件是离线/历史证据，下面区分原记录实际范围与不能推出的结论。

原文 SHA256：`7297d7259a5be59a379dd6e9c31c55e114c3588146e4b2f95709262549a1b2f9`；2068 B；1 个物理路径共用此内容。每份路径仍单独列在 @ref ros_contract_data_sources 。

该阻塞已记RESOLVED；wire_authority是旧published v1操作数值，observed_dpsdk保当时漂移值，不能把旧SDK操作别名用于当前运行，亦不声称当前仍漂移。修复commit/运行identity与下一ROS验收分层保留。

| 层 | 原记录 |
| --- | --- |
| `schema` | `1` |
| `handoff` | `R06-to-DPSDK-operation-enum-blocker` |
| `status` | `RESOLVED` |
| `hardware` | `none` |
| `wire_authority` | `{"release":"dummy-wire-v2","payload_sorted_sha256":"39c460051675e0defe3529cb6c6e5ec518327576a3c8ed1607522a612daebaf1","operations":{"ENABLE_HOLD":5,"BEGIN_MOTION":6,"CANCEL_MOTION":7,"STOP_AND_DISARM":8,"GET_OPERATION":11,"COMPLETE_MOTION":13},"receipt_queued":1,"result_pending":23,"core_states":{"ENABLING_HOLD":3,"ENABLED_HOLD":4,"RUNNING":5,"FAULT_LATCHED":9}}` |
| `observed_dpsdk` | `{"commit":"78092cb84cb8a856938736d26497fb1e7512ee15","enum_alignment_commit":"a24c017","source":"applications/dummy_ref_control/include/dummy_ref/core_types.hpp","operations":{"ENABLE_HOLD":7,"BEGIN_MOTION":8,"COMPLETE_MOTION":9,"CANCEL_MOTION":10,"STOP":11,"QUERY_RESULT":13},"wire_dispatch":"comm/dummy_node.cpp copies request.operation directly into ManagementRequest"}` |
| `impact` | `["The operation/receipt/result/core-state enum drift is resolved by DPSDK commit a24c017.","Runtime status identity is resolved by DPSDK commit 648582f.","DummyNode populates device_id, profile_id and operation_status; Capture-before-Grant and the rebuilt D08 peer pass ROS R06/R07."]` |
| `ros_behavior` | `ROS uses the published C05 values, accepts no legacy aliases, and retains strict runtime contract/profile/permit validation.` |
| `resolution_required` | `["Resolved: DPSDK maps published wire operation values and D06 passes 26/26.","Resolved: D08 publishes runtime hashes and authorization status, with DISARMED raw-state visibility.","Resolved: every manage_v1 receipt/query response populates device_id and profile_id.","Resolved: GET_OPERATION terminal responses populate operation_status and result_code.","Resolved: ROS R06 and R07 pass against the rebuilt Capture-before-Grant D08 peer."]` |

