| `release_artifacts` | `["docs/dummy/ros-runbook.md","docs/dummy/backend-matrix.md","docs/dummy/versions.lock","patches/zenbedded_dummy_v1/README.md"]` | 历史发布说明/锁等路径，不是固件image发行批准。 |
| `software_evidence` | `{"R06":"PASS（23 个用例）","R07":"PASS（8 个用例）","R08":"PASS（1 个用例）"}` | 软件R任务结果标签，与hardware NOT_RUN分开。 |
| `known_limitations` | `["实体 J1 与所有带电运动均未运行","碰撞几何与位置伺服属于仿真假设","MoveIt 在成功完成无头断言后的 Ctrl-C 清理阶段仍可出现信号 11"]` | 已知限制的历史原记，不推定当前HEAD仍有同缺陷或已经消除。 |

@section raw_7eb35c512be17f1f docs/dummy/task-reports/v3-repair-checkpoint.json

中间IN_PROGRESS快照，虽R00–R05有通过计数，R06/7/8及enum/runtime身份等当时未完成；不能用后来的RESOLVED/最终报告覆盖其历史边界。

原文 SHA256：`7eb35c512be17f1f1cccb2a21724e950cc4b2beaa0c9ad921f1c775371a10275`；1285 B；1 个物理路径共用此内容。每份路径仍单独列在 @ref ros_contract_data_sources 。

| 报告键 | 原快照内容 | 阶段/来源/范围 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `schema` | `1` | 报告/交接格式修订号，不是wire schema minor。 |
| `status` | `IN_PROGRESS` | 原快照结论，PASS_WITH_LIMITATION/SUPERSEDED/IN_PROGRESS必须保留，不推当前HEAD结果。 |
| `hardware` | `none` | none说明该记录未声称实体硬件；其它软件进程可真实运行，不等纯静态。 |
| `verified_suites` | `{"R00":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R00-repair.json","cases_passed":4},"R01":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R01-repair.json","cases_passed":7},"R02":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R02-repair.json","cases_passed":6},"R03":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R03-repair.json","cases_passed":7},"R04":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R04-repair.json","cases_passed":10},"R05":{"report":"build_dummy/reports/R05-repair.json","cases_passed":7}}` | checkpoint中已经记录的软件suite及case数量，不能覆盖completion_boundaries。 |
| `component_tests` | `{"R06":21}` | 组件层已记录数量，非完整device集成成功。 |
| `completion_boundaries` | `["R03 historical upstream patch handoff needs reconciliation.","R04 production transport passed independent review and 15/15 CTest; real positive authorized peer evidence remains R06/R07 scope.","R06 production management transport and guarded JTC bridge are not complete.","DPSDK wire operation/receipt/result/core-state values drift from published C05.","R07 full device SIL chain and R08 release remain blocked."]` | 该时刻尚未闭合事项，IN_PROGRESS不能按最终R08倒填。 |
| `hardware_not_run` | `["USB","ttyACM0","SocketCAN","J-Link","physical motor motion"]` | 明确未执行物理IO/运动名单。 |
| `known_runtime_limitation` | `Successful native Gazebo tests precede MoveIt -11 during Ctrl-C teardown.` | 该历史环境运行/退出限制，不作为当前实现诊断。 |

