@section raw_646d32078897b626 docs/dummy/cylinder-service-topology-evidence.json

这份原件是离线/历史证据，下面区分原记录实际范围与不能推出的结论。

当前公开文件 SHA256：`e9387fbc339df750e36fec25528de6b92545ee70f1d3a1d47741da62cef4dce0`；2182 B；1 个物理路径共用此内容。每份路径仍单独列在 @ref ros_contract_data_sources 。

公开脱敏前的归档原文 SHA256：`646d32078897b626685a5ab92149f810fbea88a76078419ac2802c5a8a0d916c`；2242 B。章节锚沿用此旧SHA前缀，仅供稳定导航，不表示当前公开字节仍等于旧HEAD或旧原件。仅来源路径元数据已脱敏，原数值、payload与资格/运行结论未改。

只读圆柱规划场景/服务拓扑修复快照，physical_motion_executed=false。before同服务有2 providers、after6种服务各1；owner数组含public/private node名不等after仍有两服务provider。原坏路径第24 waypoint触圆柱collision，depth约.003653m；这证明当时有限样本拒撞，不是连续场景回读或密码学进程绑定。

公开副本的 `collision_recheck.source` 字段已实际改为独立来源文件名；下面据当前公开原文同步该值，其余字段与运行结论保留原记录。

| 键 | 当前公开记录/边界 |
| --- | --- |
| `readonly` | `true` |
| `physical_motion_executed` | `false` |
| `root_cause` | `Two move_group providers in domain83 returned two-cylinder and empty worlds for same service` |
| `annotation_ast_unchanged_before_fix` | `true` |
| `before_counts` | `{"/apply_planning_scene":2,"/get_planning_scene":2,"/plan_kinematic_path":2,"/check_state_validity":2,"/compute_ik":2,"/compute_fk":2}` |
| `after_counts` | `{"/apply_planning_scene":1,"/get_planning_scene":1,"/plan_kinematic_path":1,"/check_state_validity":1,"/compute_ik":1,"/compute_fk":1}` |
| `collision_recheck` | `{"readonly":true,"executed":false,"owner":[["manual_move_group","/"],["manual_move_group_private_104126917397248","/"]],"source":"moveit-events.jsonl","checked_samples":1135,"previous_path_cylinder_collision":{"positions_rad":[1.3123902664780245,0.4619978663430956,2.006518882104445,-1.3394372104711478,-0.702754696586957,-0.1260914836417063],"valid":false,"contacts":[{"a":"link5_1_1","b":"manual_cylinder_58cc3b2492cc","depth_m":0.0036529689495806016}],"record_host_ns":599209806452117,"waypoint_index":24},"home_valid":true,"colliding_goal_plan_error":99999}` |
| `targeted_tests` | `179` |
| `bringup_build` | `passed` |
| `rest_bidirectional` | `[["home_to_rest",76,193],["rest_to_home",76,193]]` |
| `limits` | `Current discovery graph consistency gate, not cryptographic process binding or continuous world-content readback` |
| `qt_fixture_regression` | `{"red":"旧Qt夹具仅伪造Apply回执，缺唯一发现图；move按钮保持禁用，原断言失败","fix":"给真实rclpy测试节点注入Graph三项发现方法，原断言及生产检查保持不变","green":"1 passed in 1.38s","domain":187,"native_process_started":false,"physical_motion_executed":false}` |

checked_samples1135是该历史回查计数，targeted_tests179/build passed/Qt RED→GREEN均仅报告自述，不自动成为当前版本的复验结果。Qt fixture只补发现图、native_process_started=false；不能把GUI用例通过当原生MoveIt或物理运动执行。

*/
